{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KNOCKOFF</strong> is a first of its kind IsoFighter/RPG that takes heavy influence from traditional 2D &amp; 3D Fighting Games. Featuring fast paced dynamic combat, the <strong>PvP Demo</strong>\u00a0will rock your world!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/gif.gif?t=1745089039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the PVP demo is available NOW, KNOCKOFF will eventually be released, featuring 15-30 hours of gameplay set in THE MAL! \u00a0Our protagonist Amy will embark on a quest to thwart the villainous Camilla Carmilla and her Goth Baddies, and along the way release a few lost souls in the process. While the full game is a ways away, You can play my FREE Demo, that will include the entire first chapter of KNOCKOFF, which will be released by December 2026. I will NOT be releasing KNOCKOFF into early access, all pre release content will be available for free through the demo system, and I will not charge a cent until KNOCKOFF is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-PLUSHCATBOY</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3269810?t=1745089039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/09e62a803c56093f7fa92ec6f62c498ad00a3749/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745089039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/b527a87e6c4c17c86239a182daa3546073cac37f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745089039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/b527a87e6c4c17c86239a182daa3546073cac37f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745089039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3416990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KNOCKOFF</strong> is a first of its kind IsoFighter/RPG that takes heavy influence from traditional 2D &amp; 3D Fighting Games. Featuring fast paced dynamic combat, the <strong>PvP Demo</strong>\u00a0will rock your world!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/extras/gif.gif?t=1745089039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the PVP demo is available NOW, KNOCKOFF will eventually be released, featuring 15-30 hours of gameplay set in THE MAL! \u00a0Our protagonist Amy will embark on a quest to thwart the villainous Camilla Carmilla and her Goth Baddies, and along the way release a few lost souls in the process. While the full game is a ways away, You can play my FREE Demo, that will include the entire first chapter of KNOCKOFF, which will be released by December 2026. I will NOT be releasing KNOCKOFF into early access, all pre release content will be available for free through the demo system, and I will not charge a cent until KNOCKOFF is complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-PLUSHCATBOY</p>","developers":["PLUSHCATBOY"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269810/header.jpg?t=1745089039","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX Mojave<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.9GHz quad-core Intel Core i7 or Apple M1 Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<